{%- doc -%}
  Hand-drawn-style line icon for one allergen, on a 64×64 grid. Thick round
  strokes in currentColor plus zero-length "dots" (the brand's dotted texture),
  so the stamp around it decides the colour.

  @param {string} icon - gluten | eggs | peanuts | soy | milk | nuts | mustard | sesame

  @example
  {% render 'smoky-allergen-icon', icon: 'gluten' %}
{%- enddoc -%}
